			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1698607">
									

<p>&#8230;this feels like a plausible potential 682 origin story. He cannot be destroyed because he was not written to be&#8230;..and the only way to get rid of him would be to destroy his story and all copies of it.</p>
<p>Not that this is what you were going for, but it came to mind as I was reading. Suffice to say, I love this.</p>

